rebooks/533-nera-athava-surali-suttida/p06.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ನನಗೆ ಬೆಟ್ಟದ ಮೇಲಕ್ಕೆ ನೇರವಾಗಿ ಸಾಗುವ ದಾರಿ ಇಷ್ಟ.","ನನಗೆ ನೇರವಾಗಿ ಮೇಲಕ್ಕೆ ಹೋಗುವ ಮೆಟ್ಟಿಲುಗಳು ಇಷ್ಟ."]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/533-nera-athava-surali-suttida/p07.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":[]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/533-nera-athava-surali-suttida/p08.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ನನಗೆ ನೇರವಾದ ಗೆರೆಗಳನ್ನು ಎಳೆಯಲು ಇಷ್ಟ."]},{"n":9,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/533-nera-athava-surali-suttida/p09.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":[]},{"n":10,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/533-nera-athava-surali-suttida/p10.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಸ್ವಲ್ಪ ಚಕ್ಕುಲಿಗಳು ಬೇಕಾ?"]},{"n":11,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/533-nera-athava-surali-suttida/p11.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಹೇ! ನನಗೂ ಅವು ಇಷ್ಟ!"]},{"n":12,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/533-nera-athava-surali-suttida/p12.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ನೇರವೋ, ಸೊಟ್ಟವೋ?"]},{"n":13,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/533-nera-athava-surali-suttida/p13.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಹೂಂ…. ನೇರವೋ ಸುರುಳಿ ಸುತ್ತಿದ್ದೋ ಯಾರಿಗೆ ಬೇಕು….","ನಮಗೆ ಹೇಗಿದ್ದರೂ ಸರಿಯೇ ಚಕ್ಕುಲಿಗಳು ಬೇಕು!!"]}],"wordCount":54}